1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,408
Kim Chen Inning qorong‘u sirlari,

2
00:00:02,428 --> 00:00:05,150
akasining o‘limi va hokimiyat uchun kurash.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:09,010
2017-yil 13-fevral, Malayziya.

4
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,490
Kuala-Lumpur xalqaro aeroporti.

5
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:16,420
Ertalabki soatlarda aeroportda odatdagidek minglab yo‘lovchilar harakatlanmoqda.

6
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:19,990
Kimdir samolyotga shoshilmoqda, kimdir ro‘yxatdan o‘tmoqda.

7
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:23,043
Shu payt bir erkak aeroport terminali bo‘ylab yurib

8
00:00:23,063 --> 00:00:23,560
boradi.

9
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:26,110
Tasodifan unga ikki ayol yaqinlashadi.

10
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:28,760
Ayollardan biri uning yuziga qo‘llarini tekkizadi.

11
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:31,370
Hammasi bir necha soniya ichida sodir bo‘ladi.

12
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:33,500
Erkak dastlab nima bo‘lganini tushunmaydi.

13
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:36,980
Ammo ko‘p o‘tmay, uning ahvoli yomonlasha boshlaydi.

14
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,360
U aeroport xodimlaridan yordam so‘raydi.

15
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:41,420
Shifokorlar uni qutqarishga ulgurmaydi.

16
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:43,090
Erkak vafot etadi.

17
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,040
Dastlab bu oddiy qotillik tuyulishi mumkin edi.

18
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:48,500
Ammo politsiya uning shaxsini aniqlagach,

19
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:51,250
butun dunyo e’tibori Malayziyaga qaratildi.

20
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:54,891
Chunki o‘ldirilgan inson Shimoliy Koreya rahbari Kim Chen Inning

21
00:00:54,911 --> 00:00:56,680
akasi, Kim Chen Nam edi.

22
00:00:56,700 --> 00:01:01,072
Eng hayratlanarlisi, tergovchilar uning tanasida VX nomli o‘ta

23
00:01:01,092 --> 00:01:03,610
zaharli kimyoviy moddani aniqlashdi.

24
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:07,264
Bu modda xalqaro konvensiyalar bilan taqiqlangan kimyoviy qurollar

25
00:01:07,284 --> 00:01:08,450
qatoriga kiradi.

26
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:10,870
Ammo savollar shu bilan tugamadi.

27
00:01:11,020 --> 00:01:15,108
Nega Shimoliy Koreya rahbarining akasi Malayziyada yashirincha harakatlanayotgan

28
00:01:15,128 --> 00:01:15,630
edi?

29
00:01:15,820 --> 00:01:17,800
Aeroportdagi ikki ayol kim edi?

30
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:21,130
Ular haqiqatan ham qotillik rejasidan xabardor bo‘lganmi?

31
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:23,969
Va eng muhimi, Kim Chen Namning o‘limidan kim

32
00:01:23,989 --> 00:01:24,990
manfaatdor edi?

33
00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:28,540
Bugun biz Shimoliy Koreyadagi hokimiyat uchun kurash,

34
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:32,053
Kimlar oilasining sirli tarixi va xalqaro siyosatdagi eng

35
00:01:32,073 --> 00:01:34,400
shov-shuvli suiqasdlardan birini ko‘rib chiqamiz.

36
00:01:34,420 --> 00:01:36,620
Bu voqea real hodisalar,

37
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:40,210
sud jarayonlari va xalqaro jurnalistik surishtiruvlarga asoslanadi.

38
00:01:40,440 --> 00:01:44,900
1948-yilda Koreya yarimorolining shimoliy qismida Koreya Xalq

39
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:46,700
Demokratik Respublikasi tashkil topdi.

40
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:48,960
Uning birinchi rahbari Kim Ir Sen edi.

41
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:52,240
U mamlakatda kuchli markazlashgan siyosiy tizim yaratdi.

42
00:01:52,260 --> 00:01:55,797
1994-yilda Kim Ir Sen vafot etgach,

43
00:01:55,817 --> 00:01:57,820
hokimiyat uning o‘g‘li Kim Chen Irga o‘tdi.

44
00:01:57,840 --> 00:02:01,771
Shu tariqa Shimoliy Koreyada hokimiyat bir oilaning keyingi

45
00:02:01,791 --> 00:02:02,890
avlodiga o‘tdi.

46
00:02:03,180 --> 00:02:05,320
Kim Chen Irning bir nechta farzandi bor edi.

47
00:02:05,340 --> 00:02:07,320
Ulardan biri Kim Chen Nam edi.

48
00:02:07,340 --> 00:02:11,435
U 1971-yilda tug‘ilgan va Kim Chen Irning to‘ng‘ich

49
00:02:11,455 --> 00:02:12,493
o‘g‘li sanalgan.

50
00:02:12,513 --> 00:02:16,376
Uzoq vaqt davomida xalqaro kuzatuvchilar uni otasining ehtimoliy

51
00:02:16,396 --> 00:02:18,422
vorislaridan biri sifatida ko‘rishgan.

52
00:02:18,442 --> 00:02:21,620
Ammo uning hayoti kutilmagan yo‘nalishda o‘zgardi.

53
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:25,249
2001-yilda Kim Chen Nam Yaponiyaga soxta pasport bilan

54
00:02:25,269 --> 00:02:26,780
kirishga urinayotganda qo‘lga olindi.

55
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:30,660
Xabarlarga ko‘ra, u Tokiodagi Disneylend ko‘ngilochar bog‘iga borishni

56
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,643
rejalashtirgan.

57
00:02:31,663 --> 00:02:35,050
Bu voqea xalqaro matbuotda katta shov-shuvga sabab bo‘ldi.

58
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:37,890
Kim Chen Nam Yaponiyadan chiqarib yuborildi.

59
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:41,649
Keyingi yillarda u asosan Shimoliy Koreyadan tashqarida,

60
00:02:41,669 --> 00:02:44,710
jumladan Makao va boshqa Osiyo hududlarida yashadi.

61
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:48,580
Asta-sekin hokimiyat vorisligi masalasida uning ukasi Kim Chen In

62
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:49,570
oldinga chiqdi.

63
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:52,780
2011-yilda Kim Chen Ir vafot etdi.

64
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:55,820
Shimoliy Koreyaning yangi rahbari Kim Chen In bo‘ldi.

65
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:58,904
Ammo uning akasi Kim Chen Nam mamlakatga qaytib,

66
00:02:58,924 --> 00:03:01,460
siyosiy hokimiyat uchun ochiq kurash boshlamadi.

67
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:05,560
Shunga qaramay, u xalqaro jurnalistlarga Shimoliy Koreyadagi hokimiyatning

68
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:09,060
oilaviy meros sifatida o‘tishiga tanqidiy munosabat bildirgan edi.

69
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:12,550
Bu esa uning siyosiy ahamiyati haqida savollar tug‘dirardi.

70
00:03:12,860 --> 00:03:14,800
Kim Chen Nam va Kim Chen In bir

71
00:03:14,820 --> 00:03:18,200
otadan tug‘ilgan, ammo onalari boshqa bo‘lgan aka-ukadir.

72
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:21,590
Ularning hayoti mutlaqo boshqa yo‘nalishda davom etdi.

73
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,860
Kim Chen In Shimoliy Koreya armiyasi,

74
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:27,660
xavfsizlik tizimi va hukmron partiya ustidan hokimiyatni mustahkamladi.

75
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,680
Kim Chen Nam esa xorijda yashadi.

76
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:32,875
U siyosiy hokimiyatga ochiq da’vo qilmagan bo‘lsa-da,

77
00:03:32,895 --> 00:03:35,394
sobiq rahbarning to‘ng‘ich o‘g‘li ekani sababli,

78
00:03:35,414 --> 00:03:39,034
ayrim kuzatuvchilar uni ehtimoliy muqobil rahbar sifatida ko‘rishgan.

79
00:03:39,054 --> 00:03:41,863
Bu esa Shimoliy Koreyadagi hokimiyat tizimining o‘ziga xos

80
00:03:41,883 --> 00:03:43,290
xususiyati bilan bog‘liq edi.

81
00:03:43,460 --> 00:03:47,640
Mamlakatda siyosiy hokimiyat uzoq yillar davomida Kimlar oilasi

82
00:03:47,660 --> 00:03:48,903
atrofida shakllangan.

83
00:03:48,923 --> 00:03:52,641
Shu sababli oila a’zolarining siyosiy mavqei oddiy qarindoshlik

84
00:03:52,661 --> 00:03:54,810
masalasidan ancha muhim hisoblanardi.

85
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:58,339
2013-yilda yana bir keskin voqea yuz berdi.

86
00:03:58,359 --> 00:04:01,599
Kim Chen Inning amakisi va Shimoliy Koreyaning nufuzli

87
00:04:01,619 --> 00:04:04,480
amaldorlaridan biri Chan Son Tek hibsga olinib,

88
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:05,400
qatl etildi.

89
00:04:05,420 --> 00:04:08,860
Shimoliy Koreya rasmiylari uni davlatga xiyonatda aybladi.

90
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:12,176
Bu voqea Kim Chen In davrida siyosiy hokimiyat

91
00:04:12,196 --> 00:04:15,010
qanchalik qattiq nazorat qilinayotganini ko‘rsatdi.

92
00:04:15,340 --> 00:04:18,028
Ammo Kim Chen Namga nisbatan qanday qarorlar qabul

93
00:04:18,048 --> 00:04:21,569
qilingani haqida ochiq va ishonchli ma’lumotlar juda cheklangan.

94
00:04:21,589 --> 00:04:25,268
Ayrim tahlilchilar uning mavjudligi siyosiy xavf sifatida ko‘rilgan

95
00:04:25,288 --> 00:04:26,900
bo‘lishi mumkinligini taxmin qilishgan.

96
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:30,133
Lekin bu taxmin uning o‘limiga kim buyruq berganini

97
00:04:30,153 --> 00:04:31,060
isbotlamaydi.

98
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:36,019
2017-yil 13-fevral kuni Kim Chen Nam Kuala-Lumpur aeroportidan

99
00:04:36,039 --> 00:04:37,920
Makaoga uchishni rejalashtirgan edi.

100
00:04:37,940 --> 00:04:41,378
U aeroportda ro‘yxatdan o‘tish hududiga yaqinlashgan paytda ikki

101
00:04:41,398 --> 00:04:42,840
ayol unga hujum qildi.

102
00:04:42,860 --> 00:04:45,690
Kuzatuv kameralari bu harakatlarni qayd etgan.

103
00:04:45,710 --> 00:04:49,200
Ayollardan biri Indoneziya fuqarosi Siti Aisyah edi.

104
00:04:49,220 --> 00:04:52,270
Ikkinchisi Vyetnam fuqarosi Doan Thi Huong.

105
00:04:52,660 --> 00:04:54,736
Politsiya ularni qisqa vaqt ichida aniqlab,

106
00:04:54,756 --> 00:04:55,510
hibsga oldi.

107
00:04:55,530 --> 00:04:58,621
Ammo tergov jarayonida kutilmagan ma’lumot paydo bo‘ldi.

108
00:04:58,641 --> 00:05:02,080
Ikkala ayol ham o‘zlarini qotillikda ongli ravishda ishtirok

109
00:05:02,100 --> 00:05:06,060
etgan shaxslar emas, balki aldangan insonlar sifatida tasvirlashdi.

110
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:10,313
Ularning aytishicha, noma’lum erkaklar ularga televizion ko‘ngilochar dastur

111
00:05:10,333 --> 00:05:12,819
uchun hazil sahnalarda qatnashishni taklif qilgan.

112
00:05:12,839 --> 00:05:15,377
Ular avval ham begona insonlarga yaqinlashib,

113
00:05:15,397 --> 00:05:19,155
yuziga zararsiz modda surtishga o‘xshash harakatlarni bajarishganini aytishdi.

114
00:05:19,175 --> 00:05:22,371
Ayollar Kim Chen Namga qilingan harakatni ham navbatdagi

115
00:05:22,391 --> 00:05:25,120
televizion hazil deb o‘ylaganliklarini bildirishdi.

116
00:05:25,140 --> 00:05:28,710
Ammo bu safar ishlatilgan modda oddiy suyuqlik emas

117
00:05:28,730 --> 00:05:29,088
edi.

118
00:05:29,108 --> 00:05:31,510
Bu VX nerv agenti edi.

119
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:34,242
Kim Chen Namning yuziga modda tekkandan so‘ng uning

120
00:05:34,262 --> 00:05:35,600
ahvoli tez yomonlashdi.

121
00:05:35,620 --> 00:05:38,162
U aeroportdagi tibbiy punktga murojaat etdi.

122
00:05:38,182 --> 00:05:41,890
Ammo ko‘p o‘tmay kasalxonaga olib ketilayotganda vafot etdi.

123
00:05:41,980 --> 00:05:46,129
Malayziya tergovi va sud-tibbiy ekspertizasi uning o‘limiga VX

124
00:05:46,149 --> 00:05:48,300
bilan zaharlanish sabab bo‘lganini aniqladi.

125
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:52,360
VX dunyodagi eng xavfli nerv agentlaridan biri hisoblanadi.

126
00:05:52,380 --> 00:05:55,120
U asab tizimining normal ishlashini izdan chiqaradi va

127
00:05:55,140 --> 00:05:57,185
og‘ir zaharlanishga sabab bo‘lishi mumkin.

128
00:05:57,205 --> 00:06:01,411
Bunday moddaning xalqaro aeroportda ishlatilgani jiddiy xavfsizlik savollarini

129
00:06:01,431 --> 00:06:01,956
tug‘dirdi.

130
00:06:01,976 --> 00:06:04,480
Chunki aeroport — ommaviy joy edi.

131
00:06:04,500 --> 00:06:06,280
U yerda minglab yo‘lovchilar,

132
00:06:06,300 --> 00:06:08,620
xodimlar va boshqa insonlar harakatlanardi.

133
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:11,700
Bu hodisa faqat bitta insonning o‘limi bilan bog‘liq

134
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:15,336
jinoyat emas, balki kimyoviy quroldan foydalanish bilan bog‘liq

135
00:06:15,356 --> 00:06:17,347
xalqaro mojaro sifatida ham baholandi.

136
00:06:17,367 --> 00:06:20,556
Malayziya politsiyasi hujumga aloqador deb hisoblangan bir nechta

137
00:06:20,576 --> 00:06:22,060
Shimoliy Koreya fuqarosini qidirdi.

138
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:26,352
Tergovchilarning ma’lumotlariga ko‘ra, gumonlanuvchilardan ayrimlari qotillik sodir

139
00:06:26,372 --> 00:06:28,410
bo‘lgan kuni Malayziyadan chiqib ketgan.

140
00:06:28,660 --> 00:06:32,160
Keyinchalik Birlashgan Millatlar Tashkiloti ekspertlari ham bu voqea

141
00:06:32,180 --> 00:06:34,430
yuzasidan e’lon qilingan ma’lumotlarni o‘rgandi.

142
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:39,233
2018-yilda Amerika Qo‘shma Shtatlari hukumati Shimoliy Koreya hukumati

143
00:06:39,253 --> 00:06:41,920
Kim Chen Namni o‘ldirish uchun VX ishlatgan degan

144
00:06:41,940 --> 00:06:43,280
rasmiy xulosani e’lon qildi.

145
00:06:43,300 --> 00:06:46,800
Shimoliy Koreya esa qotillikka aloqadorligini rad etdi.

146
00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:49,957
Ammo bu ishdagi eng muhim savol ochiq qolaverdi.

147
00:06:49,977 --> 00:06:51,721
Suiqasdni kim rejalashtirgan?

148
00:06:51,741 --> 00:06:53,830
Va yakuniy buyruq qayerdan kelgan?

149
00:06:54,180 --> 00:06:57,516
2017-yilda ikki ayolga qotillik ayblovi qo‘yildi.

150
00:06:57,536 --> 00:07:00,780
Malayziya qonunchiligiga ko‘ra, ular o‘sha paytda o‘lim jazosiga

151
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,222
hukm qilinishi mumkin edi.

152
00:07:02,242 --> 00:07:06,360
Sud jarayoni xalqaro ommaviy axborot vositalari tomonidan kuzatildi.

153
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:10,599
Himoya advokatlari ayollar aldanganini va haqiqiy tashkilotchilar boshqa

154
00:07:10,619 --> 00:07:11,980
shaxslar bo‘lganini ta’kidladi.

155
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:16,210
2019-yil mart oyida esa kutilmagan qaror qabul qilindi.

156
00:07:16,370 --> 00:07:19,495
Siti Aisyahga qo‘yilgan qotillik ayblovi bekor qilindi va

157
00:07:19,515 --> 00:07:20,600
u ozod etildi.

158
00:07:20,620 --> 00:07:23,309
Oradan ko‘p o‘tmay Doan Thi Huongga nisbatan ham

159
00:07:23,329 --> 00:07:25,940
qotillik ayblovi yengilroq ayblovga almashtirildi.

160
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:29,712
U xavfli vosita yordamida zarar yetkazish aybini tan

161
00:07:29,732 --> 00:07:31,970
oldi va qamoq jazosiga hukm qilindi.

162
00:07:32,100 --> 00:07:34,320
Keyinchalik u ham ozodlikka chiqdi.

163
00:07:34,340 --> 00:07:37,777
Natijada Kim Chen Namning o‘limi bo‘yicha ikki ayoldan

164
00:07:37,797 --> 00:07:40,770
hech biri qotillikda aybdor deb hukm qilinmadi.

165
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:45,120
Qotillikni rejalashtirganlikda gumon qilingan Shimoliy Koreya fuqarolari esa

166
00:07:45,140 --> 00:07:47,730
Malayziya sudida javobgarlikka tortilmadi.

167
00:07:48,020 --> 00:07:52,109
Bu holat xalqaro jamoatchilikda yangi savollarni paydo qildi.

168
00:07:52,129 --> 00:07:54,960
Agar ikki ayol haqiqatan ham aldangan bo‘lsa,

169
00:07:54,980 --> 00:07:56,470
ularni kim boshqargan?

170
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:59,823
Kimyoviy modda qayerdan kelgan va nega bu operatsiya

171
00:07:59,843 --> 00:08:02,450
aynan Kuala-Lumpur aeroportida amalga oshirilgan?

172
00:08:02,620 --> 00:08:06,280
Bu savollarning barchasiga ochiq sud jarayonida yakuniy javob

173
00:08:06,300 --> 00:08:07,150
berilmadi.

174
00:08:07,740 --> 00:08:10,394
Kim Chen Namning o‘limidan keyin Janubiy Koreya va

175
00:08:10,414 --> 00:08:13,903
AQShdagi rasmiylar Shimoliy Koreya bilan bog‘liq ayblovlarni ilgari

176
00:08:13,923 --> 00:08:14,320
surdi.

177
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:18,580
Ayrim tahlilchilar qotillikni hokimiyat uchun ehtimoliy raqibni

178
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:20,340
yo‘q qilish harakati sifatida baholadi.

179
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:24,380
Boshqalar esa bu voqea Shimoliy Koreya rahbariyatining xorijdagi

180
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:27,850
tanqidchilarga nisbatan ogohlantirishi bo‘lishi mumkinligini taxmin qildi.

181
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:32,350
Ammo bu taxminlarning barchasi isbotlangan fakt bo‘lmaydi.

182
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:35,556
Kim Chen Inning shaxsan buyruq bergani ochiq sudda

183
00:08:35,576 --> 00:08:36,690
isbotlanmagan.

184
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:40,920
Shubhasiz, VX ishlatilgani, Kim Chen Namning o‘ldirilgani va

185
00:08:40,940 --> 00:08:44,462
operatsiya bilan bog‘liq Shimoliy Koreya fuqarolari tergov markaziga

186
00:08:44,482 --> 00:08:46,270
tushgani hujjatlashtirilgan.

187
00:08:46,340 --> 00:08:49,705
Bu voqea Malayziya va Shimoliy Koreya o‘rtasidagi diplomatik

188
00:08:49,725 --> 00:08:51,470
munosabatlarni ham keskinlashtirdi.

189
00:08:51,620 --> 00:08:54,220
Ikki mamlakat o‘rtasida elchixona xodimlari,

190
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:57,854
tergov va jasadni qaytarish masalalari yuzasidan mojaro kelib

191
00:08:57,874 --> 00:08:58,500
chiqdi.

192
00:08:58,520 --> 00:09:02,822
Oddiy aeroportdagi bir necha soniyalik hujum xalqaro diplomatik

193
00:09:02,842 --> 00:09:04,110
inqirozga aylandi.

194
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:06,360
Endi hikoyamiz boshiga qaytamiz.

195
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:09,110
Bir oilada tug‘ilgan ikki aka-uka.

196
00:09:09,300 --> 00:09:12,754
Ulardan biri dunyodagi eng yopiq siyosiy tizimlardan birining

197
00:09:12,774 --> 00:09:13,720
rahbariga aylandi.

198
00:09:13,740 --> 00:09:17,090
Ikkinchisi esa yillar davomida xorijda yashadi.

199
00:09:17,500 --> 00:09:21,870
2017-yilda u Malayziyadagi aeroportda o‘ldirildi.

200
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:23,960
Uning o‘limi xalqaro tergovlar,

201
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:26,908
kimyoviy qurol haqidagi xulosalar va bir necha yil

202
00:09:26,928 --> 00:09:29,480
davom etgan sud jarayoniga sabab bo‘ldi.

203
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:33,680
Ammo suiqasdning barcha tashkilotchilari va buyruq beruvchilari

204
00:09:33,700 --> 00:09:36,570
haqidagi savollar hanuz to‘liq hal etilmagan.

205
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:39,310
Bu voqea bizga bir narsani ko‘rsatadi.

206
00:09:39,420 --> 00:09:43,200
Ba’zan siyosiy hokimiyat bilan bog‘liq eng murakkab mojarolar

207
00:09:43,220 --> 00:09:45,960
davlat rahbarlarining rasmiy uchrashuvlarida emas,

208
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:49,380
dunyoning boshqa bir burchagida sodir bo‘lgan jinoyat orqali

209
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:50,480
yuzaga chiqadi.

210
00:09:50,500 --> 00:09:53,580
Kim Chen Nam hech qachon Shimoliy Koreya prezidenti

211
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:54,060
bo‘lmagan.

212
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:57,140
U ukasiga qarshi ochiq siyosiy kurash ham boshlamagan.

213
00:09:57,160 --> 00:10:01,360
Ammo uning o‘limi dunyo siyosatidagi eng shov-shuvli suiqasdlardan

214
00:10:01,380 --> 00:10:03,490
biri sifatida tarixda qoldi.

215
00:10:03,940 --> 00:10:07,400
Sizningcha, Kim Chen Namning o‘limi ortida siyosiy hokimiyat

216
00:10:07,420 --> 00:10:08,380
uchun kurash turganmi?

217
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:11,498
Yoki bu voqeaning biz bilmagan boshqa sabablari ham

218
00:10:11,518 --> 00:10:11,880
bormi?

219
00:10:11,900 --> 00:10:13,800
Fikringizni izohlarda yozib qoldiring.

220
00:10:13,820 --> 00:10:18,310
Chunki bu qotillikdagi eng muhim savol hanuz ochiq.

221
00:10:18,380 --> 00:10:20,840
Kim Chen Nam qanday o‘ldirilgani ma’lum,

222
00:10:20,860 --> 00:10:24,540
ammo uning o‘limiga yakuniy buyruqni aynan kim bergani

223
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:26,930
hozirgacha sud orqali aniqlanmagan.

